SCOPE / CAKUPAN

This MIT licence covers the work created for this repository:

  * web/            the web ports, shared library, and documents
  * reviews/        the analyses of the original programs
  * run/*.bat       the DOSBox launchers
  * dosbox-games.conf, and the Markdown files at the repository root

It does NOT cover the original BASIC sources in run/*.BAS and the other
period artefacts distributed with them. Those are of mixed provenance —
commercial (Friendlyware and others), public domain, magazine type-in
listings, and user-group disks — dating from 1978 to 2000. They are
reproduced here for study, commentary, and historical preservation. Their
individual rights, where any still subsist, remain with their respective
authors and publishers.

If you hold rights to any file in run/ and want it removed, open an issue
and it will be taken down.

Lisensi MIT ini mencakup karya yang dibuat untuk repositori ini, dan TIDAK
mencakup berkas BASIC asli di run/*.BAS beserta artefak seangkatannya.
